<title>JAPAN: Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</title>
<headline>Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mikuni and Co Ltd said on Friday it had  assigned the following preliminary ratings to planned bond issues:</p>
<p>-AA-</p>
<p>Toppan Printing Co Ltd, 50 billion yen unsecured due 2007.</p>
<p>-BBB-</p>
<p>Tokyo Electron Ltd, 20 billion yen unsecured due 2002.  </p>
<p>-BB-</p>
<p>Hitachi Construction Machinery Co Ltd,</p>
<p>10 billion yen unsecured due 2002,</p>
<p>10 billion yen unsecured due 2004.</p>
<p>-B-</p>
<p>Sumitomo Osaka Cement Co Ltd, 10 billion yen unsecured due 2004.</p>
<p>Taiyo Co Ltd, seven billion yen unsecured convertible due 2004.  </p>
<p>-CCC-</p>
<p>Cosmo Oil Co Ltd,</p>
<p>10 billion yen unsecured due 2002,</p>
<p>10 billion yen unsecured due 2007.</p>
<p>-CC-</p>
<p>Akai Electric Co Ltd, 20 billion yen unsecured convertible due 2001,  private placement.</p>
</text>
